30. MOST IMPORTANT INTERVIEW QUESTIONS
--------------------------------------

Q. What is Docker?
A. Containerization platform.

Q. Difference between Image and Container?
A.
Image = Blueprint
Container = Running instance

Q. What does docker ps do?
A. Show running containers.

Q. What does docker ps -a do?
A. Show all containers.

Q. What does -it mean?
A.
-i = Interactive
-t = Terminal

Q. What does -d mean?
A. Detached/background mode.

Q. What does -p 8081:80 mean?
A.
Host port 8081 mapped to
container port 80.

Q. What is ENTRYPOINT?
A. Main executable of container.

Q. What is CMD?
A. Default arguments passed to ENTRYPOINT.

Q. What is Dockerfile?
A. File used to build Docker images.

Q. What does docker exec -it do?
A. Enter running container.

Q. What does docker logs do?
A. Show container logs.

Q. What does docker image inspect do?
A. Show image metadata.

